{"meta": {"source": "FB Data Download (DYI JSON archive)", "chat_name": "Ohana means Family", "chat_id": "962639783771350", "scraped_at": "2026-05-19", "window_start": "2023-05-01", "window_end": "2026-05-09", "days_covered": 1104, "total_messages": 8973, "total_senders": 6, "call_events_filtered": 0, "reaction_events_filtered": 0, "system_events_filtered": 49, "cutoff_reached": false, "oldest_msg_seen": "2023-05-01", "archive_file": "facebook-bubakazouba-2026-05-19-l5ZGnBta.zip", "archive_date_range_in_zip": "2023-05-01 to 2026-05-09", "last_ui_change": "2026-05-19: Extended to full 3yr window (2023-05-01 to 2026-05-09, ~9k msgs). pair_coactivity recomputed from 3yr data. Topic data carried from 2026-05-10 classification (1yr window); topic re-classification deferred (LLM budget).", "topic_data_note": "WARNING: topic_distribution / topic_starters / topic_examples carry over from the 2025-05-09→2026-05-08 (1yr) window classification. These topic labels cover only ~33% of the messages now displayed. All other analyses (heatmap, reactions, latency, length, language, photos, mentions, pair_coactivity) cover the full 3yr window.", "methodology": "Scraped via Messenger CDP (scroll-to-top loop, ~150 passes). EXCLUDED: audio/video call events, group video call tiles, reactions, system messages (join/leave/rename). LINKS detected via: (1) all a[href] in article DOM, (2) regex on full text body, (3) l.messenger.com redirect URLs decoded (u= param). Domain classification via urllib.parse hostname (not substring). Facebook profile mention links excluded.", "methodology_v2": "Type classifier v2 applied to raw 635 records. Priority order: gif (forwarded a GIF text) > image (messenger_media anchor OR sent N photos text) > video (facebook.com/share/v/ or share/r/ anchor) > link (any real external URL, profile @mentions excluded) > text (default). Call events excluded upstream. YouTube/IG shares counted as \"link\", not \"video\". Types are mutually exclusive (first match wins).", "methodology_v3": "Video classifier v3 (2026-05-05): Split video into subtypes. ZERO direct uploads found -- messenger_media anchors are images only; all prev \"video\" entries were FB link previews, not camera-roll uploads. video_fb = facebook.com/share/v/ (FB native video) OR /share/r/ (FB reel) -- 27 total. video_yt = youtu.be / youtube.com/watch / youtube.com/shorts -- 14 total. video_ig = instagram.com/reel or /p/ -- 2 total. video_uploaded = 0 (none detected; DOM does not expose media type for messenger_media attachments). DOM signatures: FB reel anchor href=facebook.com/share/r/<id>/ with page title as text; YT via l.messenger.com redirect decoded (u= param) to youtu.be/<id>.", "methodology_v4": "Re-scrape v4 (2026-05-05): Full history captured via React fiber loadPrevious() loop (CDP). 3359 DOM articles total, 737 window messages (vs 589 prior). @-mention profile URLs (facebook.com/<numeric_id>/) now excluded from FB link counts. video_uploaded=0 confirmed: all messenger_media anchors have imgAlt=\"Open photo\", never \"Open video\". Totals: video_fb=33, video_yt=18, video_ig=2, type_video=53.", "methodology_v5": "FB Data Download (DYI) JSON archive -- ground truth, no DOM scraping. Archive: facebook-bubakazouba-2026-05-08-otsvpzYw.zip (1.27 GB, 1 of 1 parts). Thread: ohanameansfamily_962639783771350/message_1.json. 2581 total msgs in archive (2025-05-09 to 2026-05-08), 1082 in 6-month window (excl 6 unsent/deleted). Type classifier: audio > gif > video_uploaded (mp4 direct) > image (photos[]) > share.link domain (video_fb: /reel/ /videos/, video_yt: youtu.be/youtube.com, video_ig: /reel/ /p/) > link_facebook > link_other > text. DOM was blind to: 18 direct video uploads (mp4 camera-roll) which had imgAlt=Open photo in CDP. CDP total 737 vs DYI 1082 = 345 missed messages (47% undercount).", "methodology_v6": "Reclassification v6 (2026-05-05): Per Sahmoud request, FB reels, FB video shares, YT video links, and IG reel links are now classified as LINK subtypes -- not \"video\". Only m[\"videos\"] (real camera-roll MP4 uploads) remain as type=video. New link subtypes: link_fb_reel (facebook.com/reel/ or /share/r/), link_fb (all other FB shares incl /share/v/ /videos/), link_yt (youtu.be / youtube.com), link_ig (instagram.com), link_other (text URLs + unknown). type_totals.link = sum of all five subtypes and must equal the donut sum. Fixes the bug where filter Link(18) vs donut Facebook=41 were inconsistent (old link_fb was not folded into link count).", "methodology_v10": "Extended analyses v10 (2026-05-05): 8 new sections computed from FB DYI persistent archive. (1) Time-of-day heatmap: 24×7 (hour × day-of-week UTC) per member. (2) Reactions: who gives/receives, emoji preferences, reaction-pair matrix, top-5 viral msgs. (3) Response latency: time-to-first-reply from a different member, avg/median per member (24h cap). (4) Message length: avg/median/p90 word count for text messages; histogram in 5 buckets. (5) Language ratio: per-message heuristic (Arabic U+0600-06FF chars vs Latin alpha); arabic/english/mixed/other. (6) Photo leaderboard: direct uploads (photos[]) per member, album vs single, avg per share. (7) Mention analysis: @Name regex search; FB DYI has no structured mention metadata. (8) Viral messages: top-5 by reaction count.", "methodology_v11": "Language detection now distinguishes Franco-Arabic (Arabizi) from English (v11, 2026-05-05). Three buckets: arabic (>50% of letters are Arabic Unicode U+0600-06FF, or >40% in mixed messages), franco_arabic (Latin-dominant but contains Arabizi signals: digit [2,3,5,7,9] sandwiched by letters on both sides, e.g. 5lst/ba2y/ya3ny; OR presence of common Egyptian Arabizi tokens e.g. msh/ana/enta/keda/yalla), english (Latin-dominant, no Arabizi signals). Messages with no letter characters (emoji/punctuation only) are excluded from the percentage denominator. Short ambiguous messages default to english unless Arabizi signals are present.", "methodology_v12": "Topic re-classification v12 (2026-05-10): topic_distribution and topic_starters regenerated from full 12mo window (2025-05-09 to 2026-05-08, 1396 classified msgs). claude-sonnet-4-5 classifier, 11 labels.", "methodology_v13": "3yr extension (2026-05-19): Window widened from 2yr (2024-05-09) to full archive (2023-05-01 to 2026-05-09). All computed analyses (heatmap, reactions, latency, length, language, photos, mentions, viral) now cover ~9k messages across ~3 years. pair_coactivity recomputed from scratch using 30min sliding window on full 3yr corpus. Topic classification NOT re-run (LLM budget); topic data remains from 1yr window and covers only ~33% of the extended window -- flagged in topic_data_note."}, "totals": {"facebook": 173, "instagram": 0, "youtube": 103, "other": 224}, "members": [{"display_name": "Aya", "total_msgs": 2187, "facebook": 28, "instagram": 0, "youtube": 9, "other_links": 27, "first_msg": "2023-05-01", "last_msg": "2026-05-09", "most_shared_domain": "facebook", "type_text": 1678, "type_image": 279, "type_audio": 14, "type_gif": 54, "type_video": 98, "type_video_uploaded": 98, "type_link": 64, "type_link_fb_reel": 16, "type_link_fb": 12, "type_link_yt": 9, "type_link_ig": 0, "type_link_other": 27}, {"display_name": "Ali", "total_msgs": 1623, "facebook": 0, "instagram": 0, "youtube": 7, "other_links": 18, "first_msg": "2023-05-01", "last_msg": "2026-05-09", "most_shared_domain": "youtube", "type_text": 1489, "type_image": 72, "type_audio": 1, "type_gif": 4, "type_video": 32, "type_video_uploaded": 32, "type_link": 25, "type_link_fb_reel": 0, "type_link_fb": 0, "type_link_yt": 7, "type_link_ig": 0, "type_link_other": 18}, {"display_name": "Amena", "total_msgs": 1604, "facebook": 6, "instagram": 0, "youtube": 11, "other_links": 55, "first_msg": "2023-05-01", "last_msg": "2026-05-01", "most_shared_domain": "youtube", "type_text": 1310, "type_image": 203, "type_audio": 6, "type_gif": 4, "type_video": 9, "type_video_uploaded": 9, "type_link": 72, "type_link_fb_reel"